# Versification "Bible Strong FMAR": an overlay on bs-ost, for the Martin Bible (FMAR).
#
# Martin numbers as Ostervald, its revision's neighbour, except in the chapters below. Lines
# that bs-ost gives to a verse FMAR does not have are dropped with it (Mark 9:51 and 10:53).
#
# Mapping lines go from FMAR to org. Each was checked against the alignment of the FMAR text
# with the LSG text (docs/research/versification.md, section 2.4).
#
PSA 30:13 40:18 69:36 102:28 108:13 140:13
ECC 12:14
HOS 12:14
JON 2:10
MRK 9:50 10:52
ACT 24:28
1CO 3:23
REV 12:17
#
# Psalms 30 and 40, Matthew 11, Mark 9-10 and 1 Corinthians 3 are numbered as org.
PSA 40:17 = PSA 40:17
MAT 11:2 = MAT 11:2
1CO 3:22 = 1CO 3:22
#
# Romans 3:22 holds 3:23, as in OST, and Romans 8:20 ("…dans l'espérance qu'elles seront aussi
# délivrées de la servitude de la corruption…") holds 8:21, whose number FMAR does not print.
ROM 8:20 = ROM 8:20
ROM 8:20 = ROM 8:21
#
# Psalm 69: FMAR 69:2 ("Délivre-moi, ô Dieu, car les eaux me sont entrées jusque dans l'âme. Je
# suis enfoncé dans un bourbier profond…") is org 69:2 and 69:3.
PSA 69:2 = PSA 69:2
PSA 69:2 = PSA 69:3
PSA 69:3-36 = PSA 69:4-37
#
# Psalms 102, 108 and 140 put the title in verse 1, as the English Bibles: FMAR 102:1 ("Prière
# de l'affligé… Éternel ! écoute ma prière…") is org 102:1 and 102:2.
PSA 102:1 = PSA 102:1
PSA 102:1 = PSA 102:2
PSA 102:2-28 = PSA 102:3-29
PSA 108:1 = PSA 108:1
PSA 108:1 = PSA 108:2
PSA 108:2-13 = PSA 108:3-14
PSA 140:1 = PSA 140:1
PSA 140:1 = PSA 140:2
PSA 140:2-13 = PSA 140:3-14
#
# Ecclesiastes 12 opens two verses earlier, as in OST, and its last verse ("Mon fils garde-toi
# de ce qui est au-delà de ceci… Crains Dieu… Parce que Dieu amènera toute oeuvre en jugement…")
# is org 12:12, 12:13 and 12:14.
ECC 12:3-13 = ECC 12:1-11
ECC 12:14 = ECC 12:12
ECC 12:14 = ECC 12:13
ECC 12:14 = ECC 12:14
#
# Hosea 12:14 ("Puis l'Éternel fit remonter Israël hors d'Égypte… Mais Éphraïm a provoqué Dieu…")
# is org 12:14 and 12:15.
HOS 12:14 = HOS 12:14
HOS 12:14 = HOS 12:15
#
# Jonah 2:10 ("Mais moi, je te sacrifierai… Alors l'Éternel fit commandement au poisson…") is
# org 2:10 and 2:11.
JON 2:10 = JON 2:10
JON 2:10 = JON 2:11
#
# Acts 24 has 28 verses: FMAR cuts org 24:18 in two (24:19 "Et c'étaient de certains Juifs
# d'Asie,").
#! &ACT 24:18-19 = ACT 24:18
ACT 24:20-28 = ACT 24:19-27
#
# Revelation 12:17 ends with "Et je me tins sur le sable de la mer": it is org 12:17 and 12:18.
REV 12:17 = REV 12:17
REV 12:17 = REV 12:18
